	"Id": 664154,
	"Name": "Stardew Notifications",
	"Author": "Koihime Nakamura",
	"TagLine": "This mod provides notifications for production, harvesting, and events in the game. Useful for those who just want reminders and heads up about what's going on.",
	"Description": "StardewNotification\n\nStardewNotification is a mod for the game Stardew Valley. The mod shows notification messages for different events that occur throughout the game.\n\nThis is an updated and maintained version of the original mod.\n\nFeatures\n- birthdays\n- reminds you to give a birthday present if you haven't at 5:00pm (time can be customized)\n- traveling merchant days\n- when your tool upgrades are ready\n- when spirits are very happy (daily luck &gt; 0.07)\n- when new queen of sauce airs\n- festival days\n- winterstar festival notification also reminds you who your secret santa is\n- salmon berry / blackberry / and increased seashell spawnrate days\n- when items spawn in farm cave\n- when production in shed are ready to be harvested\n- when production around the farm are ready to be harvested\n\nNote: This mod was originally made by monopandora, and will be removed if they request it.",
